; ACT sink alongside two BTM (+) sinks in ONE O-template list: exercises
; prefix_subsumption_resources with a mixed BTM/ACT WriteResourceRequest set
; (WriteResourceRequest::ACT never pjoins with a BTM -> its own resource slot).
; Also a second accumulation check via read-back.
(foo 1) (foo 2) (foo 3)
(exec 0 (, (foo $a)) (O (+ (plus $a)) (ACT g8mix (cuu $a)) (+ (plus2 $a))))
(exec 1 (I (ACT g8mix (cuu $a))) (, (back $a)))
